{"synopsis":"[Oleh Author yang membawakan <Return Of Frozen Player>! dan oleh Studio yang membawakan <Academy’s Undercover Professor, Lazy Prince Becomes A Genius, dan masih banyak lagi>!]\n\nMaster dari White Magic Tower, Oscar Sage, dan para mage harus mengorbankan segalanya, termasuk juga dengan nyawa mereka demi masa depan umat manusia.\n\n20 telah berlalu dan Oscar Sage membuka matanya lalu melihat ke arah cermin, Dia melihat sosok Mage Level 1 yang hanya bisa menggunakan spell-spell dasar, Dan White Magic Tower saat ini sedang terancam dikeluarkan dari League of the Four Tower.\n\nBersumpah ingin mengembalikan White Magic Tower ke masa jayanya. Master menara, Oscar, telah kembali dan memulai kehidupan keduanya.","alternative_title":"마탑의 문제아들","author":"Jerry M, Saemmi","artist":"Yeong Myeong","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1a52a3fa-3c12-46f6-ab87-f254b6fcd879","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"767de860-0022-4188-b678-be859256e368","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"9ec45fb2-6fd4-483b-96f7-c6d2c872464e","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"8af14dcb-f1a7-4fd0-9c5e-4145675d8436","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"dfad97ea-54f1-4761-a106-4cec15b31175","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-06-28","released":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"29685928-0c06-4ef5-813c-b48dd7cf7e6e","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7c00080e-7e12-4dc0-ae5e-3ab046610c0c","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0b4584b0-3f3c-441f-83bd-397c8c28818a","numb